  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1364447230273104}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 383
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 公孙兄所言极是，如今魔门蠢蠢欲动，我们在探访仙府时还是通力合作，减少损失为上。
